  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7ce02c1f8c657064e91da607aebe315a, type: 2}
    text: *Slow to a stop.
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7ce02c1f8c657064e91da607aebe315a, type: 2}
    text: ...She was just here.
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7ce02c1f8c657064e91da607aebe315a, type: 2}
    text: No... She wouldn't just leave like that. She said she was waiting.
